OL,3,GNEWSADemolition road works to last 'few
OL,4,Amore weeks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRestrictions on one of Nottingham's
OL,7,Fbusiest roads, which have caused major
OL,8,Fcongestion in the city centre, will
OL,9,Fcontinue to the end of November, it has
OL,10,Fbeen confirmed.
OL,12,FMaid Marian Way, normally a dual
OL,13,Fcarriageway, has become a single lane
OL,14,Fcontraflow due to the demolition of the
OL,15,Fcar park which straddles the route.
OL,17,FThe works began on 28 September and
OL,18,Fcaused long queues on roads as well as
OL,19,Fdelays for bus and tram services.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
