OL,3,GNEWSADemolition road works to last 'few
OL,4,Amore weeks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FInitial estimates of the project gave
OL,7,Fan end date of "late October or
OL,8,FNovember" but now the city council and
OL,9,FHomes England have said demolition
OL,10,Fwould not be completed until the end of
OL,11,Fnext month.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
